Skill entry points docstrings are SSOT for skill documentation.
If you update these docstrings, there is no need to do identical updates in autosaxs-docs/skills_reference.md or "saxs-processing" skill documentation.
You should just regenerate them using autoSAXS commands:
$autosaxs get-docs -o <destination>  # regenerates README.md and  autosaxs-docs/skills_reference.md
$autosaxs get-skills -o <destination>  # regenerates "saxs-processing" skill
